{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/749c0d19434d1e73a9d692d1b35f540c.avif?t=1772465217\" width=1560 height=442 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/01c43f08a24637a32ff8e06d50259369.webp?t=1772465217\" width=644 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Deeply Personal Roleplaying Experience</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your choices shape more than just the story\u2014they forge Salem's very identity. As loyalty clashes with forbidden love in an evil regime, every decision pulls you deeper into his inner conflict. With multiple unique endings waiting to be discovered, your Salem could become a hero, villain, or something far more complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/19630bb5a04c244684c3ddf42c6f27d1.poster.avif?t=1772465217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/19630bb5a04c244684c3ddf42c6f27d1.webm?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/19630bb5a04c244684c3ddf42c6f27d1.mp4?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Character Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Characters remember your actions and evolve alongside your choices. Betray a friend, and they'll never look at you the same way. Show unexpected kindness, and enemies might become allies. Your relationships transform with each playthrough, creating a truly personalized experience every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.poster.avif?t=1772465217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.webm?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.mp4?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every second counts</strong>  <br>When the clock starts ticking, your instincts reveal who you truly are. Face tense moments where hesitation means death, and split-second decisions determine who lives and who dies. For fans of emotionally charged narratives with real consequences, <i>Rottenroots</i> delivers the adrenaline rush of genuine moral dilemmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/01c43f08a24637a32ff8e06d50259369.webp?t=1772465217\" width=644 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.poster.avif?t=1772465217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.webm?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.mp4?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Hauntingly Beautiful Dystopia</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a solarpunk world corrupted by evil, the line between utopia and nightmare blurs with each passing day. As Salem navigates a society where conformity means survival, every secret harbored is another root growing deeper. Experience a world where technology and nature intertwine, and resistance blooms in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Why You'll Love Rottenroots</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a personality system where your actions shape Salem's character traits, unlocking unique dialogue options and story paths with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings ranging from heart-wrenching tragedy to bittersweet triumph, each reflecting the culmination of your moral choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmospheric, hauntingly beautiful art by <strong>Laura Meggers</strong> , whose distinctive blend of hand-drawn elements and digital techniques brings this dystopian world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack featuring heartfelt melodies and high-energy tracks that enhance every moment.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3177730?t=1772465217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/bea67730d139b832ef2cb02b96921e0272a7da6d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772465217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/0f9c7eb06052c4a97d28ae742d2daef9ae138661/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772465217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/0f9c7eb06052c4a97d28ae742d2daef9ae138661/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772465217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature content related to violence and intense scenes, presented solely through text in the visual novel format. All actions are contextualized within the narrative and are not gratuitously emphasized."},"demos":[{"appid":3547500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're thrilled to announce that our demo has gotten a substantial 3.0 update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This one's big. We're talking a complete character rewrite, 433 on-screen choices, brand-new stat-check mechanics where your decisions can literally make you fail, and 154,500 words of story waiting to wreck you emotionally. Oh, and we added hidden lore. Good luck finding it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update came straight from your feedback and 3.5 months of relentless work. Dive in and experience it for yourself - we can't wait to hear what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your continued support, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Team at Klabautermann Games</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/749c0d19434d1e73a9d692d1b35f540c.avif?t=1772465217\" width=1560 height=442 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\