ynamic Character Relationships</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Characters remember your actions and evolve alongside your choices. Betray a friend, and they'll never look at you the same way. Show unexpected kindness, and enemies might become allies. Your relationships transform with each playthrough, creating a truly personalized experience every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.poster.avif?t=1772465217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.webm?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/91df52b62f9b94e6f190798f588d1d1c.mp4?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every second counts</strong>  <br>When the clock starts ticking, your instincts reveal who you truly are. Face tense moments where hesitation means death, and split-second decisions determine who lives and who dies. For fans of emotionally charged narratives with real consequences, <i>Rottenroots</i> delivers the adrenaline rush of genuine moral dilemmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/01c43f08a24637a32ff8e06d50259369.webp?t=1772465217\" width=644 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.poster.avif?t=1772465217\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.webm?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/9848aa3d10b0514157c39d022a888832.mp4?t=1772465217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Hauntingly Beautiful Dystopia</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a solarpunk world corrupted by evil, the line between utopia and nightmare blurs with each passing day. As Salem navigates a society where conformity means survival, every secret harbored is another root growing deeper. Experience a world where technology and nature intertwine, and resistance blooms in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/ace86e43809efe850764ab910caee3a0.webp?t=1772465217\" width=652 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Why You'll Love Rottenroots</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a personality system where your actions shape Salem's character traits, unlocking unique dialogue options and story paths with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings ranging from heart-wrenching tragedy to bittersweet triumph, each reflecting the culmination of your moral choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmospheric, hauntingly beautiful art by <strong>Laura Meggers</strong> , whose distinctive blend of hand-drawn elements and digital techniques brings this dystopian world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack featuring heartfelt melodies and high-energy tracks that enhance every moment.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/extras/3141ff9f27722709a0b85364aa791c0c.webp?t=1772465217\" width=643 height=46 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2>","developers":["Klabautermann Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177730/90e26b2b9668234f7dbf8938590eb89e8aec559f/header.jpg?t=1772465217","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3177730/897695675/55acb2016248c80bba20c70953b4aa3541d787d0/1765493696/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765494510","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3